cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "scenario-spine: scenario generation, ODD coverage and a calibrated difficulty score for automated driving"
abstract: >-
  A scenario bench that generates driving scenarios from a description language,
  measures pairwise interaction coverage of a declared ODD, fits a difficulty
  score's weights to simulation, and evaluates a learned surrogate against an
  analytic baseline. Includes a MUSA/MTT GPU implementation of the predictor's
  forward pass, verified against a numpy reference.
type: software
authors:
